  "fullDescription": "If you have an iPad and PROCREATE app, you’ll be happy to get realistic oil paint brushes for your artwork!\n\nBring the tactile experience of oil painting to your iPad with this set of 12 realistic oil brushes for Procreate. These brushes deliver authentic textures and brushstrokes, perfect for creating rich, dynamic digital art. Additionally, this set includes a special canvas brush that mimics real canvas texture, enhancing the depth and realism of your artwork.\n\nWhether you’re layering thick, impasto strokes or blending colors smoothly, these brushes offer the full pleasure of oil painting in a digital format. Perfect for artists who love the texture and feel of traditional media.\n\nHow To Use:\n1. Download the files on your iPad\n2. Click on .brushset files\n3. Procreate will automatically install all the brushes and they will appear at the top of your brush list",
